    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303-a8">

                <pb facs="0366" n="1100" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1100"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8 in No. 151.—Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Telegram sent consul at Warsaw October 5:</p>
                <p>Was Yablkowski’s passport viséed to enter Russia?</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peirce</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chargé</hi>.</p>
                <p>Telegram received from Warsaw October 6:</p>
                <p>Yablkowski particulars in my yesterday letter.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rawicz</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></p>
                <p>Telegram sent consul at Warsaw October 7:</p>
                <p>Letter received. Reply to question asked. Was passport viséed?</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peirce</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chargé</hi>.</p>
                <p>Telegram received from Warsaw October 10:</p>
                <p>Yablkowski’s passport viséed Danzig, January 7.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rawicz</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></p>
                <p>Telegram sent October 10 to consul at Warsaw:</p>
                <p>Was Yablkowski’s passport viséed to enter Russia, and by whom? Answer quick.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peirce</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chargé.</hi></p>
                <p>Telegram received October 10:</p>
                <p>Wired yesterday. Yablkowski’s passport viséed Danzig, Prussia, to enter
                    Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rawicz</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consul.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
